# forma CLI architecture

Framework: **urfave/cli/v3**. Root command in `internal/cli`; `main` configures logging and runs the root command. Nested Go module: `cmd/forma/go.mod`.

## Layout

```
cmd/forma/
  main.go
  go.mod
  templates/scaffolds/<name>/   # embedded; every file ends in .tmpl
  internal/cli/                 # root + subcommands
  internal/cli/app/             # pal Run wrapper
  internal/cli/subcommands/init/  # package initcmd
  internal/templates/           # (templates live in cmd/forma/templates package)
  pkg/cmdexec/
```

## Pal

Subcommand work runs through `app.Run` with explicit `pal.ServiceDef` lists (no global registration). Init uses `deps.Services(gotool + runner)`; after scaffold it calls `synccmd.RunWithComponents` (nested pal graph). Sync/generate provide the real worker with CLI fields as the pal runner (`ProjectSyncer`, `generatecmd.Runner`) — no proxy. Cross-package DI ports live in `internal/core/interfaces.go`. Use `InjectSlog()` via `app.Run`. Version subcommand does not use pal.

Runner/port naming and no-proxy rules: see `pal-runners.mdc`.

## Init

- Full init: **empty directory only**; writes **in place** (partial tree on error is acceptable).
- `--only-config`: write `forma.yaml` if missing; fail if present; no `go mod init`.
- Templates: `text/template`, default `--template minimal`.
- Stub sync after full init: `go mod edit -require` + optional `FORMA_REPLACE` + `go mod tidy`.

## External commands

Use `pkg/cmdexec.Run` for `go` with live stdio.

## Exit codes

0 success, 1 any error.

## Tests

Prefer external `*_test` packages for CLI tests under `internal/cli`. Integration tests build the real binary as a subprocess.
